<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Category icon for the Bypass Blocking settings section.
  The intrinsic size has to be 24dp like every other icon in that list: TextCell
  measures its icon view AT_MOST and then pins its left edge at a fixed offset, so
  a 28dp box would push the artwork two device pixels further right than the rows
  above and below it. The viewport stays at 28 so the paths below keep their
  original coordinates and are simply scaled down into the 24dp box.
-->
